  "updated_at": "2026-03-29",
  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the artistry of Pigmentum Tattoo, Limburg an der Lahn's premier tattoo studio, where the beauty of minimalist designs, the depth of black & gray, and the vibrant splash of watercolor come to life on skin. With a serene and welcoming environment, Pigmentum Tattoo is the go-to destination for patrons seeking a personalized and refined inking experience. For consultation and appointments, kindly reach out at info@pigmentum.tattoo.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Limburg An Der Lahn, Hesse, Germany"
}